      "body_text": "It was her stomach that woke her up. It was growling and screaming for food.\n- \"You growl like a lioness!\" François said while laughing.\n- \"You're mean !\" she replied mockingly hitting his arm. He faked a terrible pain and laugh some more. At least, they were still laughing ...\nFew seconds later.\n- \"We should try to find some food. Anything. I hope we won't starve to death ...\"\n- \"Don't worry, i am sure we will find something. Go East, i'll go west. The island is not huge, so scream if you have something. I'll do the same.\"\n- \"Ok we do that.\" She was happy to see François still had strength for some initiatives and decisions making.\n\n\n\nEmilie began to search everywhere. She climbed, crawled, explored. Nothing. Not a coconut, not some fruits she didn't know or some roots she never heard about.\nShe began to despair.\n\nThere it was. A strange mushroom under a even stranger tree. The touched it carefully, smelled it. It was smelling good. So good it made her licking her lips.\n\n\nShe called François and few minutes after they were together with the strange mushrooms.\n- \"Should we cook it ?\" he was asking her.\n- \"With what? No i think we can bite directly in it.\"\n\nEat the mushroom with François.",
      "body_html": "It was her stomach that woke her up. It was growling and screaming for food. <br><span class=\"Francois\"><i>- \"You growl like a lioness!\" </i></span>François said while laughing. <br><span class=\"Emilie\"><i>- \"You're mean !\" </i></span> she replied mockingly hitting his arm. He faked a terrible pain and laugh some more. At least, they were still laughing ...<br>Few seconds later.<br><span class=\"Emilie\"><i>- \"We should try to find some food. Anything. I hope we won't starve to death ...\"</i></span><br><span class=\"Francois\"><i>- \"Don't worry, i am sure we will find something. Go East, i'll go west. The island is not huge, so scream if you have something. I'll do the same.\"</i></span><br><span class=\"Emilie\"><i>- \"Ok we do that.\" </i></span> She was happy to see François still had strength for some initiatives and decisions making. <br><br><img src=\"img/1st chapter/7b.jpg\" width=\"50%\"><br><span class=\"macro-linkreplace-insert\"><br>Emilie began to search everywhere. She climbed, crawled, explored. Nothing. Not a coconut, not some fruits she didn't know or some roots she never heard about. <br>She began to despair.<br><span class=\"macro-linkreplace-insert\"><br>There it was. A strange mushroom under a even stranger tree. The touched it carefully, smelled it. It was smelling good. So good it made her licking her lips. <br><br><img src=\"img/1st chapter/7c.jpg\" width=\"50%\"><br>She called François and few minutes after they were together with the strange mushrooms. <br><span class=\"Francois\"><i>- \"Should we cook it ?\"</i></span> he was asking her.<br><span class=\"Emilie\"><i>- \"With what? No i think we can bite directly in it.\"</i></span><br><br><a class=\"link-internal macro-linkreplace\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\">Eat the mushroom with François.</a><span class=\"macro-linkreplace-insert\"></span> </span> </span> ",
